  "details": "I discussed it with some friends and one said I should run it by people somehow.\n\nWhen someone creates an instance, they have options on whoever they wish to invite. Now, how about the option to disable emotes? Since the crashers ( if I recall correctly ) depend on an emote to do it. Keeping it an option wouldn't take anything away from anyone and the users would have some amount of control against this. I don't know much about technical things like this but it was worth a shot bringing it up.\n\nI'm going to emphasize this: It is an OPTION when a person creates an instance. It is ENTIRELY up to the creator of the instance.\n\nI really do adore VRChat, it's helped me tremendously and I love every bit of it! Which is why I want to see it advance. I appreciate you taking the time to read this and if there are nuances that would prevent this idea from happening, it's fine. After all, it was simply an idea.\n\nHave a nice day!",
